{"slug":"add-binary","id":67,"title":"Add Binary","difficulty":"Easy","tags":[],"fn":"addBinary","params":[["a","string"],["b","string"]],"types":["string","string"],"ret":"string","cmp":"exact","desc":"<p>給定兩個二進位字串 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code>，以二進位字串的形式返回它們的和。</p>\n<p>字串僅由字元 <code>0</code> 或 <code>1</code> 組成，且除了 \"0\" 本身外不含前導零。</p>","constraints":["1 ≤ a.length, b.length ≤ 10⁴","a 和 b 只由 '0' 或 '1' 組成","除了 \"0\" 以外，字串都沒有前導零"],"starter":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def addBinary(self, a: str, b: str) -> str:\n        ","typescript":"function addBinary(a: string, b: string): string {\n    \n};","javascript":"/**\n * @param {string} a\n * @param {string} b\n * @return {string}\n */\nvar addBinary = function(a, b) {\n    \n};"},"examples":[{"args":["11","1"],"out":"100"},{"args":["1010","1011"],"out":"10101"}],"tests":[{"args":["0","1"],"out":"1"},{"args":["1","1"],"out":"10"},{"args":["1111","1"],"out":"10000"},{"args":["111011111111101001001010111110010000010110100","1110101011010001110101111110001110110"],"out":"111100001110010100011100110100001110100101010"},{"args":["101110100100110001000101","1000010010"],"out":"101110100100111001010111"},{"args":["10010111000010110100111101110","111010000101110000000110111010000"],"out":"111100011100110010111011110111110"},{"args":["111100011000100111100111010010001001111","10"],"out":"111100011000100111100111010010001010001"},{"args":["1011110100011110101000110110","110011000101000000110110"],"out":"1100100111100011101001101100"},{"args":["1011000110100110001001010110001101001","10100111001000110100011010001"],"out":"1011001001001101010010001010100111010"},{"args":["11111111001100001110","1100000011011011001011101001110010010011010100011001"],"out":"1100000011011011001011101001110110010010100000100111"},{"args":["1000000100100001101110111","1101011100001100011"],"out":"1000010001111101111011010"},{"args":["1111110101001111011001110101010011011101010100","1101001100011110000101010110"],"out":"1111110101001111100111000001110001100010101010"},{"args":["11111101110100010000101011010101101","1000101011011000000"],"out":"11111101110100011001010110101101101"},{"args":["1010000011101011111011000101110111100111100011101100001","101001010000101010101010"],"out":"1010000011101011111011000101111100110001101001000001011"},{"args":["110100101101110101011001001100100001010101100100001011","111110010010010111000000101000011110110"],"out":"110100101101111101001011011111011001011010101000000001"},{"args":["10101111110100101111000110001","10000000111000111001000011100011000111111101001000010101"],"out":"10000000111000111001000011111001000110100011000001000110"},{"args":["1101001010","1100010010101111001100"],"out":"1100010010111100010110"},{"args":["1101000010110000001010011110110101000010000000110","100011110110"],"out":"1101000010110000001010011110110101000110011111100"},{"args":["100","101011100"],"out":"101100000"},{"args":["1111011110101011001101011100100101101000100011100001","10110101010"],"out":"1111011110101011001101011100100101101000111010001011"},{"args":["110011001001110100011","101001111011001110"],"out":"111000011001001110001"},{"args":["111001010111111100001101011111000","110011000001110100010010010110001101000001"],"out":"110011001000111111010001110111111000111001"},{"args":["10101110101101101011111110101110011110000001001","10110010110111110100001000001101011111110111111101110000"],"out":"10110011001101101001110101101101010101101011101101111001"},{"args":["","1"],"out":""}],"ref":"// 從尾端逐位相加，維護進位\n// 時間複雜度: O(max(m, n))，空間複雜度: O(max(m, n))\nfunction addBinary(a, b) {\n    let i = a.length - 1, j = b.length - 1, carry = 0;\n    const digits = [];\n    while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry) {\n        let sum = carry;\n        if (i >= 0)\n            sum += a.charCodeAt(i--) - 48; // '0' 的字元碼是 48\n        if (j >= 0)\n            sum += b.charCodeAt(j--) - 48;\n        digits.push(sum % 2);\n        carry = sum >> 1;\n    }\n    return digits.reverse().join('');\n}\n","solutions":{"python":"class Solution:\n    def addBinary(self, a: str, b: str) -> str:\n        i, j = len(a) - 1, len(b) - 1\n        carry = 0\n        result = []\n        while i >= 0 or j >= 0 or carry:\n            total = carry\n            if i >= 0:\n                total += int(a[i])\n                i -= 1\n            if j >= 0:\n                total += int(b[j])\n                j -= 1\n            result.append(str(total % 2))\n            carry = total // 2\n        return ''.join(reversed(result))","cpp":"class Solution {\npublic:\n    string addBinary(string a, string b) {\n        int i = (int)a.size() - 1, j = (int)b.size() - 1, carry = 0;\n        string result;\n        while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry) {\n            int total = carry;\n            if (i >= 0) total += a[i--] - '0';\n            if (j >= 0) total += b[j--] - '0';\n            result += char('0' + total % 2);\n            carry = total / 2;\n        }\n        reverse(result.begin(), result.end());\n        return result;\n    }\n};","java":"class Solution {\n    public String addBinary(String a, String b) {\n        int i = a.length() - 1, j = b.length() - 1, carry = 0;\n        StringBuilder sb = new StringBuilder();\n        while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry != 0) {\n            int total = carry;\n            if (i >= 0) total += a.charAt(i--) - '0';\n            if (j >= 0) total += b.charAt(j--) - '0';\n            sb.append(total % 2);\n            carry = total / 2;\n        }\n        return sb.reverse().toString();\n    }\n}","typescript":"// 從尾端逐位相加，維護進位\n// 時間複雜度: O(max(m, n))，空間複雜度: O(max(m, n))\nfunction addBinary(a: string, b: string): string {\n    let i = a.length - 1, j = b.length - 1, carry = 0;\n    const digits: number[] = [];\n\n    while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry) {\n        let sum = carry;\n        if (i >= 0) sum += a.charCodeAt(i--) - 48;  // '0' 的字元碼是 48\n        if (j >= 0) sum += b.charCodeAt(j--) - 48;\n        digits.push(sum % 2);\n        carry = sum >> 1;\n    }\n    return digits.reverse().join('');\n}\n","c":"// 從尾端逐位相加，結果從字串尾端往前填\n// 時間複雜度: O(max(m, n))，空間複雜度: O(max(m, n))\nchar* addBinary(char* a, char* b) {\n    int i = strlen(a) - 1, j = strlen(b) - 1;\n    int len = (i > j ? i : j) + 2;           // 最多比較長的字串多一位\n    char* res = malloc(len + 1);\n    res[len] = '\\0';\n    int k = len - 1, carry = 0;\n\n    while (i >= 0 || j >= 0 || carry) {\n        int sum = carry;\n        if (i >= 0) sum += a[i--] - '0';\n        if (j >= 0) sum += b[j--] - '0';\n        res[k--] = '0' + sum % 2;\n        carry = sum / 2;\n    }\n    // 若最高位沒有進位，k 會停在 0，回傳從 k+1 開始的部分\n    if (k == 0) memmove(res, res + 1, len);\n    return res;\n}\n"}}